PLACEHOLDER — paste the public key here.

The managed fleet prints it: dispatch tenant-tools.yml in
prestomation/mycity.events with command: secret-transfer, filter: keygen and
the deployment you are filling. Copy the whole block, from
"-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----" to "-----END PUBLIC KEY-----", into this file.

.github/workflows/secret-export.yml seals the four platform API keys to that
key. Each deployment (dev, prod) has its own key, so this file changes once
per deployment.
